ent-MobWH40KOskvernitel = Defiler
    .desc = A daemon engine of Chaos bound into iron and spite. Its corrupted weapon mounts can be cycled between a reaper chaingun and a siege autocannon.

ent-WH40KOskvernitelWeaponMinigun = reaper chaingun
    .desc = A belt-fed daemon-forged rotary cannon that chews through infantry with relentless suppressive fire.

ent-WH40KOskvernitelWeaponAutogun = siege autocannon
    .desc = A brutal heavy autocannon mount that fires slow, punishing shells from the Defiler's hull.

ent-ActionWH40KOskvernitelOpenWeaponMenu = Weapon Selector
    .desc = Switch between the Defiler's gun mounts.
